      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5263827538005195681, guid: 8dac5f29ae479c24da09eb2ac83d5ba5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorials.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[0].text
      value: This is your cat
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5263827538005195681, guid: 8dac5f29ae479c24da09eb2ac83d5ba5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorials.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[1].text
      value: It likes pushing cups and damaging machines
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5263827538005195681, guid: 8dac5f29ae479c24da09eb2ac83d5ba5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorials.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[2].text
      value: That can be fixed with a wrench
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5263827538005195681, guid: 8dac5f29ae479c24da09eb2ac83d5ba5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorials.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[3].text
      value: You can also distract it with a yarn ball
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5263827538005195681, guid: 8dac5f29ae479c24da09eb2ac83d5ba5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorials.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[4].text
      value: But that only works for so long
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5263827538005195681, guid: 8dac5f29ae479c24da09eb2ac83d5ba5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: tutorials.Array.data[0].steps.Array.data[5].text
      value: But that only works for so long
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
